[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=52 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="最后一轮点名结束，帕金斯没有收起海图。她在回程线旁边圈了三个小点，其中一个几乎已经被雨水泡掉，纸纤维鼓起一层薄毛。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="这三处还没有回报。第一处看见我们经过，第二处领过备用电池，第三处只确认了有人。返航前都要再过一遍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我以为“都在”是说我们都能回了。你这三个点一圈，看起来像又添了半张值班表。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="就是一张值班表。我们刚才开过火，有人会以为这条路现在安全。至少把还能不能走告诉他们，再算这一趟走完。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿把空弹药箱挪开，在舱边腾出一块地方。她问如果真接上人，谁来坐。你正要回答人数还不确定，她已经拿出两条绳子，先系好了扶手。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不知道有几个人，可以先知道哪里不能坐。这里热，另一边有漏水，留中间。别等别人上来了，再让人抱着包站来站去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我去复核第三处。那里发过声音，我听过一遍。要是仍在重播，至少不会因为语气听起来着急，就把大家都带过去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="同意，但你不单独去。刚打完一场，最容易觉得自己已经把危险看透了。海图上没标出来的地方，照样得当没看清。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕拿过耳机，试了两次才把接头插稳。她把自己那只小信号器留在布袋里，向弗莱彻报了使用的频道，又重复了一遍回程的停靠次序。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="第二处电池可能不够用了。我们在值班室拿走那一块以后，临时码头那边就只剩一个备用，不能让他们以为有人还会再送。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们清点剩下的电池。一块能用，一块外壳裂了，最后一块没有标签。拉姆森看了眼时间，把没标签的那块放回工具包，没有拿来凑数。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="看着一样不算测过。要是把坏的当成好的送过去，明天再有人说“你们明明给过”，这件事就更难解释了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那可用的先去第二处，坏的带回。第一处的人能不能走到第二处？如果距离不远，可以共用一个收信点，不用每个地方都等一块电池。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="得问他们自己。我们走过去只觉得是几步路，有人受着伤，有人还守着不能搬的设备。别替他们算得太轻松。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第一处回信很慢。对面的人先问你们还带不带热食，听见没有，便说自己也没准备多余的碗。帕金斯听完反而把这一条从“待确认”移到“有人回应”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="他说这些，是不是在生气？我不确定要先道歉，还是告诉他现在能做什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="都可以，但别道歉完就以为事情办了。问他需要留在那儿的理由，再决定咱们怎么绕。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="那人说井口的阀不能空着，要是全离开，晚上没人知道进来的水是不是又变浑。他能走，阀不能跟着走。你在海图旁边添上一行“有人留守”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那我们把能听见灯塔的时段写给他。不是全天都能接通，什么时候有人回话，什么时候只能留言，都分开写。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第二处很快接受了共用收信点的办法，却又问原来挂黄色布的那一家要怎么办。他们从中午起没见到那边的人，风大以后，布也不见了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="第三处就是他们。先别传“没人了”，我们还没过去。要是你们听见有人回来，也请告诉她们别再走到外侧栏杆等。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我给你们留一小段能用的绳子。别把全部拿去吊电池，上回就是这么断的。东西掉下去以后，说什么耐水都没用了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第三处的广播果然还在说同一句话，可背景里多了一种拖动金属的响声。你听见句子重新开始时，响声仍然连着，没有跟着归零。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="有实时的声音混进来了。可以过去看。别直接停到门前，先找能转回来的位置；如果那道门打不开，就按外侧窗的办法接应。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="记录先由你保管。我这边耳机和空手都留出来。见到人以后先问还能不能走，其他事情等离开门口再说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻把备用哨子递给你。她没说拿着就不会出事，只让你现在吹一次。声音比你想象中尖，德雷顿捂着一边耳朵，笑你差点把整张海图吹跑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="听得见。频道断了就用这个。别因为觉得丢人，等到真要用的时候才发现不会吹。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我看外侧楼梯。上回那里有一段台阶没有护栏，如果还在水下，我们先找另一条，不让人抱着东西从那里跳。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把最后三个点重新描深。它们没有让回程变直，反而让绕行的线长了一截。但这回你知道，每一处弯折后面具体有谁在等，等的又是什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="回来别再站门口数箱子了，先喝水。我看见你刚才把空杯放回原位，还特地把杯柄摆得很整齐。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="被你发现了。我以为只要杯子还在那里，看起来就像我没有忘记。现在喝，喝完再走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她给你留出一口。水已经凉了，杯边有盐，你用拇指擦掉一点，重新戴好耳机。这次呼叫第三处时，你先报了自己的船名，再问他们能不能听见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="等回应时，帕金斯让你去看备用小艇。艇里放着一只一直没拆开的木箱，边缘贴满防水胶。你以为是救援物资，摸到提带以后才发现它很沉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="上一队留下的电机。带回去能修，留在这里可能就泡坏。现在需要腾地方，你来告诉我，可以先挪哪一件。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="电机能不能绑到外边？只要不再进水，里面的位置可以让出来。可我不确定绑在哪里不会挡住小艇转向。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="外边不行，绳子一松就会挂到下面。现在能做的是把外壳和能拆的部件分开，拆得慢一些，分开就能塞进不同的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你问需要多久，拉姆森抬头看了眼她自己的工具包，又看外面的水，没有马上答。弗莱彻让她报一个不需要赶工的时间，不拿最快那次当标准。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="要几分钟，还得有人举灯。里面那块垫片不能丢，丢了以后，今天省下的地方，回去可能得拿整台设备来赔。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我举灯。要是那边先回话，就先停下来，把已经拆开的包好。我们不能为了这只箱子，错过刚确认有人在的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿把一条干毛巾垫在艇底，让卸下的小零件不会滚动。她让潮痕数，自己负责装袋，两个人各念一遍，不把听见的一声响当成看见一颗螺丝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我不是不信你。艇在晃，我自己也会数错。等会儿少了一颗，我们先问掉在哪儿，别先问谁把它弄丢了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="这样我反而好数一点。以前一有人站旁边，我会只顾着想，下一颗要是忘了怎么办，忘得更快。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="箱盖卸下以后，你们发现里面还塞着一份旧报纸。拉姆森本想拿来包零件，帕金斯却先看见日期，用手压住了其中一版。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="这一张别撕。是那台设备上一次搬运的月份，可能还能查出它从哪里送过来。拿别的包，外面的空包装我还有。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="电机要修，报纸也要留。现在倒像我们一直在把“没有用”的东西重新挑出来。小时候有人教过我怎么收拾吗？我想不起来，手却一直想把纸先叠好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="你现在叠得好，也不一定要从以前找个原因。先把这一角压住，别让它飞走。等事情不着急的时候，你想记什么，我们再慢慢记。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="小艇中间终于空出一块地方。它看起来并不宽敞，甚至还能看见刚才那只箱子留下的湿印子。德雷顿把扶手绳拉紧，试了试会不会勒手。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_47"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="可以了。有人上来就先坐稳，箱子分到我们脚边。要是还放不下，先放人，再另记没带走什么，不假装船上还有看不见的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_48"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="耳机里传来第三处的回应。你把灯还给拉姆森，最后确认了一遍艇边有没有悬着的绳头，才回到自己的位置，向对面重复刚说过的接应办法。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

